<title>JAPAN: Ishikawajima Hanyoki - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Ishikawajima Hanyoki - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 12.66		vs	   12.44</p>
<p> Operating	  301    million    vs	  370    million</p>
<p> Current	    302    million    vs	  367    million</p>
<p> Net		  198    million    vs	  217    million</p>
<p> EPS		   32.07 yen	  vs	   37.01 yen</p>
<p> Shares		6 million	  vs	   6 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Ishikawajima Hanyoki Service Co Ltd inspects and maintains machinery as well as designing and selling airconditioning equipment.</p>
